{"id": "EUVD-2026-103011", "enisaUuid": "0e731b83-9d3c-3d4c-9874-d7f16bad1f5c", "description": "Roncoo-pay through commit 9428382 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in F2FPayController.orderQuery that allows unauthenticated attackers to retrieve payment records by supplying a trxNo parameter. Attackers can guess transaction numbers, a '7' prefix plus a snowflake ID, to obtain the full serialized payment record of any merchant.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:40:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T21:25:01", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/roncoo-pay-f2f-order-query-unauth-record-disclosure", "https://github.com/roncoo/roncoo-pay/blob/9428382af21cd5568319eae7429b7e1d0332ff40/roncoo-pay-web-gateway/src/main/java/com/roncoo/pay/controller/F2FPayController.java#L75-L79", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/roncoo-pay-through-commit-9428382-information-disclosure-via-f2fpay-order-query"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111719", "GHSA-pxmf-cjhq-vjc3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9e68995b-00b2-3079-bfa5-319263cf1cd5", "product": {"name": "roncoo-pay", "vendor": {"name": "roncoo"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22649428382af21cd5568319eae7429b7e1d0332ff40"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4d398eb2-f269-3cc0-b356-7583f134ef53", "vendor": {"name": "roncoo"}}], "isExploited": false}